            "heading": "Product Care and Use",
            "description": "<p>For more than 30 years, Carrol Boyes has produced high quality designs backed by expert manufacturing processes. We want our customers to enjoy their pieces of functional art for many years to come, which is why we have compiled a product care guide to help you take the best possible care of your products.</p>",
